{"id":"01a0657e-138e-7ee9-81fa-991a09602e76","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude – The Antinium Wars (Pt-2)","paragraph":12,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"zel-shivertail","holderQuote":"My name is Zel Shivertail. I am a Level 15 [Lieutenant] in command of Geir’s remaining forces, as I believe all higher-ranking officers are now dead"}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-73db-afd6-22e84c2bd350","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude – The Antinium Wars (Pt-2)","paragraph":14,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"zel-shivertail","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"zel-shivertail","holderQuote":"I am a Level 15 [Lieutenant] in command of Geir’s remaining forces, as I believe all higher-ranking officers are now dead"}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-7102-8b63-99bc629d747f","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude – The Antinium Wars (Pt-2)","paragraph":29,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"zel-shivertail","holderQuote":"From a Level 15 [Lieutenant], Shivertail grew to become a Level 39 [General] after his battles, one of the most incredible growths ever recorded in known history"}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-75c2-9c23-e56c2d7e4119","chapterSlug":"rw4-36 O","paragraph":16,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named"}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-767f-9225-1cdb0b635539","chapterSlug":"rw4-45","paragraph":454,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"periss","holderQuote":"She glared at him and Ilvriss recalled that she didn’t like him saying her name, even in private. It was always [Lieutenant], then [Captain], and so on as she rose in rank."}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-7722-820a-48e90f77fa9f","chapterSlug":"rw4-48","paragraph":121,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"gershal","holderQuote":"The first wave of Goblins smashed into the soldiers around Gershal. He saw a gigantic Hob charging towards him. The [Lieutenant] raised his shield, heart pounding."}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-7d46-9af3-3cd5c1955d8e","chapterSlug":"rw4-48","paragraph":313,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"reynold","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"magnolia","holderQuote":"“Reynold, you were a [Lieutenant] once. Do you know what they could do?”"}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-7717-a01b-2db5b537c798","chapterSlug":"rw4-47","paragraph":0,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"gershal","holderQuote":"[Lieutenant] Gershal of Vaunt was an unhappy man. He was not an important man, which factored into his present unhappiness. He was a low-level officer from a small city north of Invrisil. He commanded a group of disciplined but fairly low-level [Archers] and [Swordsmen], and he liked to think of himself as a decent soldier, albeit one who hadn’t fought in any wars."}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-70d4-b5b1-f08820e6ab77","chapterSlug":"rw4-47","paragraph":6,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"gershal","holderQuote":"Gershal groused to himself as he walked past a group of officers dicing and drinking wine together. His throat cried out for a taste, but the [Lieutenant] moved past them. Drinking on duty? That wasn’t a custom in his army."}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-7328-8214-12f7a3771e28","chapterSlug":"rw4-47","paragraph":37,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"gershal","holderQuote":"The [Lieutenant] looked around, worried. Salvia shook her head and pointed to a pair of [Knights] in pinkish-red armor who were striding through the camp."}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-77c3-a562-e4d41a80ee19","chapterSlug":"rw4-47","paragraph":158,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"gershal","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"gershal","holderQuote":"“I am [Lieutenant] Gershal of Vaunt! I will fight with you, General Shivertail! We do not run from Goblins! I will protect Invrisil with my men if you will lead us!”"}
{"id":"01a0657e-138e-7e7a-8caf-c3afc2171d35","chapterSlug":"rw4-44 M","paragraph":145,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holderSlug":"reynold","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"reynold","holderQuote":"“I was a [Lieutenant], sir. An officer in charge of a cavalry unit. I have…experience in combat. And in war. I fought twice against Drakes in the Bloodfields.”"}
